   :backup "~/repo-archive/cloud-itonami-kotobase-20260906.bundle, sha256 d1d50b87…. The FIRST attempt at this bundle was incomplete and was thrown away: it was taken from the stale local checkout, whose remote still pointed at gftdcojp, and it stopped at 2cdee437 while GitHub was at b8322d1d. Re-taken from a fresh --mirror clone and verified to contain the tip. A backup that silently misses the newest commit is the shape of a backup nobody checks."}

  :superseded-still-blocked
